<!--
Personal file. Copy it to CLAUDE.local.md in the repo root (that name is gitignored, so it never reaches GitHub)
and put your own id on the ayna-user line: galip, omer or hasan.
Your agent reads this line to know whose tasks and memory folder it works with;
the guard hook reads it to stop the agent from editing someone else's private memory.
-->
ayna-user: galip

